{"id":"n40549-3-7","stage":4,"title":"다스리다 · 解决","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40549-3-7-1","ko":"덥지? 이 주스로 목마름이라도 좀 다스려 봐.","zh":"热吧？喝点这个果汁，缓解一下口渴吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"덥지?","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덥지","audio":"/audio/cffa3b44adfd686f18ab.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"주스로","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주스로","audio":"/audio/7d11297b79abfd0a7684.mp3"}},{"text":"목마름이라도","meaning":"口渴","explanation":"목마름：口渴；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"목마름","audio":"/audio/39d33e8de01ea5795796.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55861","senseId":"1","lemma":"목마름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목마름이라도","audio":"/audio/f963d920d1d29ecf7873.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"다스려","meaning":"解决，减少","explanation":"다스리다：解决，减少；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"다스리다","audio":"/audio/db26970a5df8b63def84.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40549","senseId":"3","